  "what_this_is": "M4b (FIX-4 and FIX-5 of docs/results/2026-09-17-slurp-a3-coverage-confusion-audit-v1.md; docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-16-slurp-v2-base-program-design.md section 3 module M4b and section 4 cell B4b): cell B4b of the SLURP v2 base program on the cell B0 review-off base configs/baseline/slurp-native-dual-store-train-fold-a-review-off-v1.json. ONE ORG channel moves: knowledge_stores.slot-contracts is pinned to knowledge/slurp/semantic/slot-contracts-v2 (docs/readiness/2026-09-17-slurp-semantic-store-revisions-v2-review.md, pins docs/readiness/2026-09-17-slurp-semantic-store-release-pins-v2.json). Eight of the fifty-four slot cards change -- date, time, media_type, transport_type, business_type, order_type, relation and event_name -- carrying the emit-when-spoken date rule (FIX-4; 81 of 135 gold-date rows emit no date) and the spoken-form time representation rule (FIX-5; 46 of 72 rows emit a non-exact time filler), widened to the omission-dominated types table T5 names. All 402 intent bindings are byte-identical to v1, so every candidate-keyed supply decision and every slot facet key text is unchanged and only the rendered value text of those eight cards differs. Held identical to cell B0: the roster and split, the model fragment and resident geometry, the promoted speech packets, the intent-boundary store v1 with its release and snapshot hashes and the whole Perception retrieval geometry, the three-candidate / 28-value / 16-per-candidate candidate contract with no fallback candidate, every instruction template, the native episode role graph (Reviewer and Planner at max_iterations 0, max_revisions 0, review_loop off, two contacts per row) and the scorers. Because the Perception channel does not move at all, this cell's prepared first-phase supply output must equal the sealed anchor and cell B0 artifact output on all 1,080 rows. Fold B is absent. The review-off phase_tools block is carried verbatim and is inert: the review-off role graph builds no Reviewer node, so no tool action can ever be taken. It is kept because the arm speech-feature-query-native-tools declares tool_schemas and FlightRuntime.frozen_core_client_kwargs has no schema source without it, and because keeping it holds the tool block of every request identical to cell B0's. No execution plan authority, admission, scoring receipt or contact authority is created by this fragment; readiness is held and the coordinator flips it."
